    fe (written `fe: `) | Terms | The fixed effects to absorb: a variable, `firm`; several joined by `+`, `firm + year`; an interacted effect joined by `:`, `industry:year`. Int, text, category and date variables all serve; `*`, a range, an expression and the intercept are refused, and so is an effect that is also a variable of the formula.
